# Knowbase (ai-lab) — rules v2

Личная платформа: аудио → STT → корпус → конспект → Q&A с цитатами.
**Нет** карты понятий и видео-пайплайна.

## Stack

- Backend: Java 17, Spring Boot 3.4, SQLite (`JdbcTemplate`), JWT, Spring AI / OpenRouter
- Frontend: Vite + vanilla JS (без React/TS)
- Ports: API `8081`, UI `5173`
- Secrets: only `application-local.yml` / env — **never** commit keys

## Architecture

Package-by-feature under `com.ailab.*`.
Layers: `*Controller` → `*Service` → `*Repository`.
`CourseService` = **ownership + CRUD only**; aggregates → dedicated services.
Ownership: `CourseService.requireOwned(courseId)` before course-scoped work.
Errors: `IllegalArgumentException` / `IllegalStateException` / `SecurityException` → `{ "error": "..." }`; SecurityException **must be 403**.
JSON: camelCase; prefer `LinkedHashMap` for multi-key payloads.

## Domain

Materials are `lectures` rows with `source_type = MATERIAL`.

## Agent workflow

- Local: `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` (wins on conflicts)
- Global: Cursor User Rules — see `challenge/day1/GLOBAL_USER_RULES.snippet.md`
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/add-course-endpoint/SKILL.md`
- Subagents: one-shot implementers; no clarification loops on battle prompts

## Do not

- Concept-map / video features; SQL in controllers; log secrets; React/TS without request; bloat `CourseService`
